    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>At&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pH</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math>, i.e., the solubility in water is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math>,</p><p>The solubility product,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Assume the solubility of sparingly soluble salt is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>at</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pH</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>MX</mi><mo>&#8652;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>&#8853;</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>&#8854;</mo></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math></p><p>The weak dissociation reaction is as follows,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>&#8854;</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>&#8853;</mo></msup><mo>&#8652;</mo><mi>HX</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math></p><p>Assume the acid dissociation constant is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub></math>.</p><p>Now,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>HX</mi></mfenced><mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced></mstyle></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mstyle></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;assume&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#8771;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub></mstyle></mrow></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi>sp</mi></msub></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Now from 1 and 2,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>pK</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
